.TH NN-BENCHMARK 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-benchmark \- benchmark inference latency
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn benchmark [options] <model>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Warmup then timed iterations on a selected backend.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-warmup N
Warmup iterations.
.TP
.B \-\-iterations N
Timed iterations.
.TP
.B \-\-backend NAME
Runtime backend.
.TP
.B \-\-input FILE
Input tensor.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success; 7 backend unavailable.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
nn benchmark model.onnx --iterations 50
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
nn-profile(1), nn-run(1)
